Column name: is_returning Type: BOOL Description: Is the station accepting bike returns?
Column name: eightd_has_available_keys Type: BOOL
Column name: last_reported Type: TIMESTAMP Description: Timestamp indicating the last time this station reported its status to the backend, in NYC local time.
