Query:
-- 3) “Loop” trips (start and end at the same station)
-- Description:  See a sample of loop trips that might become group rides.
SELECT 
  starttime,
  start_station_id,
  end_station_id
FROM `bigquery-public-data.new_york.citibike_trips`
WHERE start_station_id = end_station_id
LIMIT 20;
Answer:
starttime,start_station_id,end_station_id
2014-09-23 15:02:45+00:00,520,520
2015-06-23 12:18:00+00:00,520,520
